    "Choose a directory with a “index.html” file." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择一个含有「index.html」文件的目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a region with “Choose Region…” in the Nifro menu: drag a rectangle over the wallpaper and that part fills the screen. The rectangle is locked to the shape of your screen, and it is remembered as a place and a magnification, so the same website works on a second display of a different shape." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用 Nifro 菜单里的「选择区域…」来选：在壁纸上拖一个框，那一部分就铺满屏幕。框锁定成你屏幕的形状，记下来的是「位置 + 倍率」而不是矩形，所以同一个网站换到形状不同的另一块屏也成立。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Local Website" : {
