    "Keep changes?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留更改吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep rendering" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "持续渲染"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the website above all other windows while browsing mode is active." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "浏览模式期间让网站保持在所有窗口之上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets you use the page without switching to Browsing Mode. The window then stops letting clicks through, so your desktop icons sit behind it, and the page has to keep rendering." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不用切到浏览模式就能操作网页。代价是窗口不再让点击穿过去，桌面图标会被挡在后面，而且网页必须一直渲染。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loads the page even though its certificate is not one macOS trusts. For a device on your own network — a router, a NAS, a dashboard on a Raspberry Pi — that is normal and this is the switch for it. On a page from the public internet an untrusted certificate means somebody may be reading or altering what you load, so leave it off there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "即使证书不被 macOS 信任也照样加载。对你自己网络里的设备——路由器、NAS、树莓派上的仪表盘——这很正常，这个开关就是为它准备的。而对来自公网的页面，证书不受信任意味着可能有人在读或改你加载的内容，那里请保持关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local Website…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本地网页…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
