          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spaces are the desktops you switch between in Mission Control, not your displays. Off means the wallpaper stays on whichever Space was in front when Nifro started. Which display a website goes on is set on the website itself, not here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「桌面」指的是调度中心里来回切换的那些虚拟桌面，不是显示器。关掉时，壁纸只留在 Nifro 启动时最前面的那个桌面上。网站放在哪块显示器上，是在网站自己的设置里定的，不在这里。"
