            "value" : "改用纯播放器页面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Useful with rotation. A news page in the morning, something calmer at night. A window that runs past midnight, 22 to 6, works." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "配合轮换很好用。早上放新闻，晚上放安静点的。跨过午夜的时段（22 到 6）也可以。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Username" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用户名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "版本 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watches what the page actually does for a minute, then keeps rendering it or switches to stills. It changes its mind again if the page starts moving." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先观察网页一分钟到底在做什么，然后决定继续渲染还是改用静图。如果网页开始动，它会改回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Website" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Websites" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Nifro!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "欢迎使用 Nifro！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When in dark mode" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "深色模式下"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When other windows cover most of the wallpaper, Nifro shrinks the window to whatever is still visible, such as the strip behind the Dock, and keeps rendering only that. When nothing is visible it holds the last frame. Turn this off to keep drawing the whole page." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当其他窗口盖住大部分壁纸时，Nifro 把窗口缩到还露在外面的那一块（比如程序坞后面那条），只渲染那一块。什么都看不见时就停在最后一帧。关掉这个开关会一直画整张网页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whether this website is allowed to make noise. Remembered per website, so a clock stays silent and a live stream does not." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个网站能不能出声。按网站分别记住，所以时钟保持安静而直播不会。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whether this website may make noise. Remembered for this website, so a clock stays silent and a live stream does not, and it is the same setting as Sound in the Nifro menu — change it in either place. Muting works by holding every audio and video element on the page muted, so it covers media and not sound a page generates with the Web Audio API." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个网站能不能出声。按网站分别记住，所以时钟保持安静而直播不会；它和 Nifro 菜单里的「声音」是同一个设置，在哪边改都行。静音的做法是把页面上每个音频和视频元素保持静音，所以覆盖媒体元素，不覆盖网页用 Web Audio API 生成的声音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While disabled, Nifro will display the website on the space that is active at launch." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭时，Nifro 只在启动时所在的那个桌面显示网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
